Affected Element: http://www.softlang.org/ontologies/ce#DataConcept

### Ontology context (Turtle)
```turtle
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
